{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/892372-illumined-path-2e-conversion-discussion","id":892372,"title":"Illumined Path (2E Conversion) - Discussion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-17T00:58:31-07:00","id":892372,"title":"Illumined Path (2E Conversion) - Discussion","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdI_lbZbLGkhaoN7CAnOM3rF2THW9MlvRD-AVrT-dVQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdI_lbZbLGkhaoN7CAnOM3rF2THW9MlvRD-AVrT-dVQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdI_lbZbLGkhaoN7CAnOM3rF2THW9MlvRD-AVrT-dVQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdI_lbZbLGkhaoN7CAnOM3rF2THW9MlvRD-AVrT-dVQ/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So, here's another Legacy conversion from me. And this one is going to be experiencing a <i>major</i> overhaul, given how broken it was. However, it's also an exception to the standard design rules in that its Primary Arcanum (Prime) is one of two Ruling Arcana of its Parent Path. This isn't a problem, though, in my opinion, given what the Legacy is all about. I don't know, what do you guys think?<br /> <br /> Anyway, I need suggestions for Attainments and Yantras, as well as what additional Skills could be added to it as a prerequisite. On a semi-related note, I've been thinking of making them be at odds with the Awakening Gambit over ideological differences, seeing as they're dealing with the Awakened condition under different points of view.<br /> <br /> Fire away.<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-17T01:31:33-07:00","id":892382,"title":"","content":"*answered in doc*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-22T04:54:26-08:00","id":1053137,"title":"","content":"<i>Finally</i> finished my writeup for this Legacy. On a related note, expect me to revisit my other conversions to make their Attainments more compliant with core rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-22T06:04:25-08:00","id":1053153,"title":"","content":"No Attainments yet for the Left-Handed version, I suppose?<br /> <br /> Hmm... actually, my knee-jerk response is to <i>not </i>come up with alternate Ruling Arcanum and Attainments for the Left-Handed version, and instead make the Guides themselves use those in more sinister ways. Been a while since I read KttST (one of the few non-2e stuff I have!), so I might have to reread it to get a grip on them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-22T06:13:39-08:00","id":1053156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/892372-illumined-path-2e-conversion-discussion?p=1053153#post1053153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No Attainments yet for the Left-Handed version, I suppose?<br /> <br /> Hmm... actually, my knee-jerk response is to <i>not </i>come up with alternate Ruling Arcanum and Attainments for the Left-Handed version, and instead make the Guides themselves use those in more sinister ways. Been a while since I read KttST (one of the few non-2e stuff I have!), so I might have to reread it to get a grip on them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the Left-Handed version still needs some more thought (along with the Yantras for the Legacy, in general). That said, the only Attainments that could be used in more sinister applications are the 4th and 5th ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category